# -------------------------------------- findings 2, 6 and 7: the extractors
#
# The fixes to step 18's extractors, from its review: no input recurses or
# is scanned once per prefix (finding 2); five common shapes that had a
# wrong outline (finding 6); the bounds on names and on what an extractor
# keeps (finding 7); `truncated` said only of a real cut; and Kotlin's
# names in backticks.

[break] a-template-chain-recurses
